# Monorepo rules

- Use pnpm workspaces; never npm/yarn for this project.
- Import shared code via `@agency/*` package names.
- Keep apps thin; put reusable logic in `packages/*`.
- Database only through `@agency/database` with **MariaDB** (Prisma `mysql` provider). Never introduce PostgreSQL.
- Third-party systems only via provider interfaces (LLM, Embedding, VectorStore, Payment, Hosting, Domain, Email, Storage).
- Prefer TypeScript strict mode; extend `tsconfig.base.json`.
- Add `.env.example` when introducing new env vars; never commit secrets.
- Before architectural or large feature work, read `DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md`, then `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` and the relevant companion doc.
